Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（1000，600）\fs90\c&HC6E1F6&\pos（674.666，912.666）}现{\fs60} 如 今
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.61,0:02:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.19,0:02:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是见了鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,横贯地铁线是欧洲最大的建设工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crossrail is the biggest construction project in europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs40\pos（1636，202）}{\3c&HACB09F&\bord0}伦敦 {\3c&H010078&\bord0\shad0} 直播
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.51,0:02:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs50\b1\c&HB1B7B9&\pos（300，786）\bord1\shad}地 铁 建 设 惊 现 古 代 遗 迹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs50\pos（1488，940.667）}BBC新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.11,0:03:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs47\bord0\shad0\pos（556.8，911.6）\c&HFFFFFF&}教授 罗宾 约翰逊 考古学部门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.59,0:02:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总长26英里的全新市郊往返地铁隧道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carving 26 miles of new commuter train tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.41,0:02:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会贯穿整个伦敦的地底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beneath the surface of London.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.05,0:02:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天 一个摆满着十字军骑士棺材的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But today, an ancient tomb filled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,古代墓穴被隧道挖掘队发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}the coffins of crusader night have unearth…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们不知道的是 伦敦是个巨大的墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't realize that London is a giant graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一座建立在世代亡魂上的现代都市\N{\fnArial\fs30}A modern city built on centuries of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,由于古墓的位置靠近泰晤士河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of the tombs proximity to the thames…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半以上的空间已经遭河水灌满 是这样吗 教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}…half the space is flooded, is that right doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 水下还有更多墓棺等着我们去挖掘\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are even more coffins submerged under water.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.45,0:03:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,墓棺看起来像是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tomb appears to have been built.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.83,0:03:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在第二次十字军远征期间修建的\N{\fnArial\fs30}during the second crusade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也就说明墓棺里都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…which means it's filled with the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们祖先回到英格兰之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}of crusader knights to invade the Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些入侵埃及的十字军骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}…before we returning to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.20,0:03:17.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也打开了地底世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has also revealed a treasure trove.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,的神秘宝库\N{\fnArial\fs30}of secrets about have unearthed…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把场子给清了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear them out, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 请停下你们手上的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, please stop what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.55,0:03:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁线路已重新规划到了北边儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train tunnel has been rerouted north of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在开始接管这个遗迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are now taking control of this site.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请收拾好你们的设备快速离开这片区域\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please collect your tools and gear and exit immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 先生 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这片区域已经封锁了 你还在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my site. what do you think you are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.05,0:04:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你的人撤离 这片遗迹现在由我们来接管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuate your men. we'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是些什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 先生 非常感谢您的配合\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, sir. thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去不可能被永久地埋藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past cannot remain buried forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.44,0:04:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的这一生 已经发掘出\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my lifetime, I have unearth…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,许许多多的古代未解之谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}…many ancient mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.06,0:04:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于 这座古墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last, this tomb…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭示了古代最黑暗的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}…reveals antiquities darkest secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.32,0:04:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一段被抹去的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secret erased from history…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,被时间忘却的秘密 终于被我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and forgotten to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.77,0:04:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,安玛奈特公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess Ahmanet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌美如花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,奸诈狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cunning…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,古埃及王朝的唯一继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sole heir to the throne of egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.26,0:04:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,法老王朝终有一日会由她来统领\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pharaohs kingdom will one day be hers to rule…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.93,0:05:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,笼罩在她那恐怖的暴政之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}…without mercy or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,安玛奈特也会被当作神祇在世般 受到人民的崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Ahmanet would be worshipped as a living god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 法老有了一个儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But pharaoh had a son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个男孩 将会承继她的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy now, would inherit her destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,安玛奈特也明白 权利不能是授予而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Ahmanet understood power was not given…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是要通过手段掠夺而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it had to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对神发誓要复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vowing revenge…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她选择了信奉邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}…she made a choice to embrace evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,古埃及的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}The god of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们签订下了契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.86,0:06:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个契约会释放黑暗的本源\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pact that would unleash darkness itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,安玛奈特得到了重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahmanet was reborn…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.69,0:06:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.36,0:07:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 契约并没就此结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet the pact was not complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她发誓要把这只恶魔带到人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}She vowed to bring the demon into our world…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,附身到一个凡人的身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the body of a mortal man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.17,0:07:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起 他们会将复仇之火降临到人类的头上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together, they would take their vengeance upon humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.60,0:07:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了赎罪 安玛奈特被活生生做成了木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}For her sins, Ahmanet was mummified alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的遗体被带到了远离埃及的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her body carried far from egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:08:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那 她会饱受无尽黑暗的包围和指责\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she would remain, condemned to eternal darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.03,0:08:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但死亡 只是通向复活的另一道大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}But death is a doorway…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去也不可能被永久地埋藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and the past cannot remain buried forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs200\pos（925.333，904.667）\c&HACB8CA&\1a&H40&\b1}新 木 乃 伊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（0，0）\fs90\c&HC6E1F6&\bord0\shad0\pos（333.333，890.666）}美{\fs60\bord0\shad0}索不达米亚
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.23,0:08:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（600，0）\fs90\c&HC6E1F6&\bord0\shad0\pos（724.666，892.666）}文{\fs60\bord0\shad0}明的摇篮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fad（600，600）\fs90\c&HC6E1F6&\bord0\shad0\pos（359.999，892.666）}如{\fs60\bord0\shad0}今名曰伊拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,运气不怎么好啊 中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of luck, ah sarge?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,平民都跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The civilians are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.60,0:08:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在那地方只剩一堆叛乱分子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is filled with insurgents down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜我们来的太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.67,0:08:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs100\bord0\shad0\c&H111820&\b1\frx0\fry0\frz17.36\pos（1400，853.999）\1a&H33&}伊拉克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.63,0:08:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs60\bord0\shad0\c&H1F3342&\b1\1a&H00&\fn黑体\frz17.72\frx2\fry0\pos（855.332，455.332）}摩苏尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fn方正舒体\1a&H45&\pos（304，304）\frx4\fry4\frz6.525}亲爱的珍妮弗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fn仿宋\1a&H45&\frx4\fry4\frz6.525\b1\i1\pos（758，394）}调查古遗迹
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fn仿宋\1a&H45&\frx4\fry4\frz6.525\b1\i1\pos（846，516）}哈拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fn仿宋\1a&H45&\frx4\fry4\frz6.525\b1\i1\pos（710，880）}北纬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs80\bord0\shad0\c&H000000&\fn方正舒体\1a&H45&\frx4\fry4\frz6.525\b1\i1\pos（1456，892）}恭呈\N\N亨利
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定能找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不不不 我们太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no no no! we're too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.51,0:09:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥部以为我们在离这里一百英里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Command thinks we are doing advanced recon…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行深入敌后的侦查任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a 100 miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.73,0:09:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,中士 你不能去那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarge, you are not going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.14,0:09:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我不能 我们要一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. i'm not. we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们起码得叫个空袭吧 - 空袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- at least call in an air strike. - air strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就丢一个炸弹 没准他们就被全部吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little one. just maybe they'll run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.53,0:09:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们的行踪就暴露啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the command will know where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.77,0:09:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就会因为打劫罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we will do 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在堪萨斯州的莱文沃斯堡（监狱）蹲上20年\N{\fnArial\fs30}in leavenworth for looting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.41,0:09:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的 我们不是劫匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what did I tell you? hey, we are not looters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是珍稀古文物的解放者\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are liberators of precious antiquities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 对头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- right. - right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们根本不知道那埋着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't even know what's down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈拉姆 那下面就埋着哈拉姆 稀有宝藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haram. haram is what's down there. treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.81,0:09:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 翻译说哈拉姆意思是「被禁止的知识」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the translator said "haram" means "forbidden knowledge".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.16,0:09:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个地方 这种词就代表着另外一个意思「宝藏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around here that's just another word for "treasure."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.59,0:09:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个叫亨利的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this guy, this… Henry guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来想要这个宝藏快想疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it seems to want it pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.17,0:09:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 看来他要付双倍价才能把这个宝藏搞到手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… now he is gonna have to pay double.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.96,0:09:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上马 准备出发 - 长官 我拒绝这次行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- mount up. - "no, sir, I ain't going on this one."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.05,0:09:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what? - i'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.44,0:09:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛 用那捅我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you going to do? "stab me with that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.84,0:10:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不不不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no no no no… no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到下个水源点之前 这可是我一天骑行的饮水量啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a full days ride to the nearest water!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.76,0:10:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近的水源 就在下面那个村子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nearest water is right down in that village.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.18,0:10:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.47,0:10:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的冒险精神去哪啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your sense of adventure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.13,0:10:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这真棒啊 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh that's just great, nick! that's just great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛 我们就像往常一样潜入进去 神不知 鬼不觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we slip in - slip out, just like we always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我滴神也\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要死啦 要死啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna die… we are gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,动起来 动起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑就对了 跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just run… run run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! go… go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我开玩笑嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,神不知 鬼不觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}"slip in - slip out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前就没这么干过好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not what we always do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼梯 快上 快上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stairs! just run! run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑 跑 跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! run! run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.53,0:10:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心手雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grenade!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你 我恨死你啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you, I hate you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都没有想过要来这个国度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even wanted to come… to this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 让我好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me think. just let me think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人听得见的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone is listening…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是L-26 我们遭到猛烈火力压制\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this is l-26, rmj hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.40,0:11:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求对我方位置实行动态精确打击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Request dynamic precision strike at our mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.92,0:11:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别跟我说你刚刚叫了空袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not… just called in an air strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.83,0:11:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 是的 我 叫 了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… yes… i… did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.77,0:11:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪 别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going? don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.18,0:11:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪冒出来这么多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do they keep coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.64,0:11:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没地方躲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢不 我们要死啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man we are gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 韦尔 让我思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Vail! let me think!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你的主意 我们就要玩完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna die because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me think!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.21,0:11:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想什么 还有什么好想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what? think about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.95,0:11:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.50,0:12:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 这次我们可能真的要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking… we are probably gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.18,0:12:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.60,0:12:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈拉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haram.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你们应该呆在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was told you boys were supposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.15,0:13:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这一百英里外的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be a 100 kil from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的长官 但是根据情报显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir! but based on intelligence…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.84,0:13:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有理由相信当地的叛乱分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we had reason to believe the insurgents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.28,0:13:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓了当地平民作人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}were holding civilian hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做出抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是等待三角洲部队增援还是我们两独自执行这次任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for delta team to respond or go in alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这实际上是莫顿中士的主意要潜入进村子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was sergeant morton's idea to go in actually!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过我们的侦查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to find out that the villagers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.13,0:13:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为战争疏散 村子里空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}are gone seems evacuating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他们可幸运了 但我们就不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah lucky for them, not for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,三角洲特战队 去村子南部设立警戒区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta, south side perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 当我们意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, when we realized that we were at the.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是叛乱分子要塞的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}center of the insurgent’s stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时已经太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.69,0:13:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后我们暴露并遭受了敌军猛烈的火力进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were discovered, we started taking on heavy fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.60,0:13:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,其次 长官 韦尔下士 太过谦虚去承认了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… sir, Corporal Vail here is too humble to admit it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:14:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他是那个冒着生命危险来救我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he risked his life to save mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 他是个英雄 我推荐他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a hero, in fact… i'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,来做传讯的口供证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to recommend him for citation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来说说我想的另一套情节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me run another scenario by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.89,0:14:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个…两个执行远程侦查任务的混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}One in which…two assholes from long range reconnaissance…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的就是你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that would be you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跑遍伊拉克北部\N{\fnArial\fs30}…run all over northern iraq,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.78,0:14:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是尽量避免与敌军交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}just one step ahead the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 你们也不是来杀敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except, instead of hunting for the enemy…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是来猎宝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you hunt for antiquities…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把一切可能挖到的宝物\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stealing whatever isn't nailed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒卖到黑市上好大赚一笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and selling it on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.42,0:14:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时 这些狂热分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, these fanatical insurgents…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.93,0:14:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,又正好想抹去这五千年的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}…trying to erase 5, 000 years of history…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.25,0:14:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不情愿的说 这的确是个不错的幌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…unwillingly cover your tracks. it's a pretty good scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.19,0:14:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫顿中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant morton!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.61,0:14:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 什么什么东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? where is what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那封信 那张你从我这偷走的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}The letter. the map you stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图 我不知道你在说些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Map? I do not know what you are talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would i…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我甚至都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had even had the opportunity to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.27,0:14:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你那偷东西的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}steal anything from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 怎么称呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss… Miss…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 莫顿中士认为这很难以启齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok… sgt. morton here thinks that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.22,0:14:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得也很羞耻\N{\fnArial\fs30}i would be too embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:14:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过事实是 三天前\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to tell you that I had him in my hotel room…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴格达的一家旅馆里 我们两一起睡过\N{\fnArial\fs30}…3 nights ago, in baghdad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在熟睡时 他偷走了我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whilst I was sleeping, he went through my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.45,0:15:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不感到尴尬 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not embarrassed, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说恶心 是的 后悔至极 啊 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusted? yes. regretful? ah certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我对你的「能力」真得是刮目相看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But mainly just amazed, to your ability…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那套高质量的套路 哇 简直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to mimic all the qualities of genuine human intimacy…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多前戏 也就坚持了 多久 十五秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if only for… 15 seconds?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.39,0:15:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图到底在哪 莫顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the map, morton?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.22,0:15:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I admit that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.98,0:15:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和哈尔西小姐的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…miss Halsey and I did spend a.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,共度良宵过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}delightful even.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她是真情实感的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very long and satisfying evening…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.54,0:15:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将会是更加漫长而完美的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if her reactions are to be considered sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.97,0:15:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是长官 我现在对她的美好回忆已经烟消云散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sir, I left with nothing more than fond memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是因为我第二天早上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, perhaps I may have neglected to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.76,0:15:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不辞而别惹怒了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}say goodbye to her the next moring…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.48,0:15:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是因为她很疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…only because she was exhausted…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在是不想吵醒她 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and I did not want to wake her. - ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如此亲切关怀竟然落得如此回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the reward for my gracious consideration?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.48,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官你看 这就是「最毒妇人心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well sir, as you can see "hell hath no fury".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 - 哦 我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sir. - oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是古埃及的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不同寻常的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is that unusual?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.11,0:15:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔 我们现在是在波斯湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in the persian gulf, Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:16:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 这里距离埃及有一千英里 这就不同寻常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. egypt is a 1000 miles away so it's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都放下吧 快 去把剩下的都搬来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put those down, hurry. go get the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.71,0:16:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 这是个重大的发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, this is an significant find.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.33,0:16:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的人手将这个村子保护起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}i need your men to secure this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.28,0:16:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们甚至都不应该出现在这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not even supposed to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.19,0:16:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的职责是确保任何有价值的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is my job to make sure that anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.93,0:16:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会落入敌人之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}of value stays out of enemy hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.57,0:16:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对这下面有什么并不是很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no idea what could be down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.81,0:16:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初图坦卡门墓穴中的文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The content of tutankhamun's tomb alone…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,估值6.5亿英镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}…were valued at 650 million pounds sterling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.39,0:16:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 恕我直言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel… if I may with a couple shake charges…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.24,0:16:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以先用炸药把洞口堵上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we could just close this hole right up,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后找个好日子再让哈尔西小姐过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and miss Halsey can cen we're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- shut up. - okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.58,0:16:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有两个小时的时间 然后我们就必须马上撤离\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got two hours, then we're moving out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.64,0:16:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们带着他一起下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are getting in the hole with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.81,0:16:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- him? - me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.93,0:16:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.78,0:16:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.26,0:16:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,收拾好就出发 这是命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gear up, that's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.45,0:16:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在路边等你 中士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right here on the road sarge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也跟着下去吧 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the damn hole, Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 大兄弟 别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh man!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目前身处于一个大型的前厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in a large antechamber of some kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,前厅的北墙上刻着几行铭文\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is an inscription on the northern wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.78,0:17:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳神 拉 哈拉胡提的祷文\N{\fnArial\fs30}The litany of ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在逗我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你 尼克 都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fault, nick. your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.68,0:17:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到这里有什么宝藏吗 尼克 我可什么都没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see any treasure here, nick? because I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我看到什么了吗 我看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I see? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是些带不走的雕像\N{\fnArial\fs30}statues that I can't carry around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.74,0:17:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小声点 - 你才小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- keep it down. - you keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是个墓穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is definitely a tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.53,0:18:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 水银吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? mercury?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,古埃及人相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ancient egyptians believed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.07,0:18:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可以抑制邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}that it weakened iest of ammon…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.45,0:18:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们如今有了更深入的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well now we know better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玩意儿能毒死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}this stuff will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.72,0:18:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 就在把你弄疯之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, after it makes you crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水银从天花板上滴下来 再回流到\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is mercury dripping from the ceiling…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,地上的洞中\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into holes in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly to connect the…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是墓穴内的运河系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a canal system…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.65,0:18:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,汇集流向\N{\fnArial\fs30}…leading all the way to…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把照射灯打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包里的东西都拿出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get everything out of the bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.09,0:19:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多金子啊 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of gold, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我目前在一个与前厅相连的人造大型墓穴中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am in a large men-made cavern adjoining the antechamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.30,0:19:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,显而易见 这里有向下延伸的阶梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are chiseled steps descending from the ledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.09,0:19:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,墓穴中央有一条运河系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a canal at the center of them…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,水银灌满底部的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that feeds a ritual well at.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭献深井\N{\fnArial\fs30}the base, filled with mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.90,0:19:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是珠子做成的圣甲虫戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beads of scarabs, scarab signal rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.48,0:20:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它属于底比斯神庙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a high priest of ammon…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位安蒙神大祭司\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from the temple of the thebes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,水银井周围由宗教性质的锁链包围着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a ritual barrier chain that's around the well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为对闯入者的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as a warning to intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻隔他们入内\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep people out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地下墓穴没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a single provision made for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.04,0:20:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何被盗的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone's journey into the underworld…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有坎努帕斯坛 没有陪葬俑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No canopic jars, no shabtis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.10,0:20:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,被埋葬在这样一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be buried in a place like this…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的是比死更难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}…would have been a fate worse than death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.25,0:20:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有六位守护者面朝井口\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are six watchers around the well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而并非朝向外边\N{\fnArial\fs30}…facing inward instead of out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论这里面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever is in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.22,0:20:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些锁链都不是为了把它拉出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…those chains aren't for bringing it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.52,0:20:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是在镇压\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are for holding it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是个坟墓\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a tomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.26,0:21:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫 L26 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lima 2-6, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.43,0:21:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上出来 我们收到报告 有可疑人士入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out now. we've got reports of bogeys inbound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须马上撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉格林威 我们必须通知国防安全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell greenway we have to notify d.t.r.a.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.65,0:21:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.54,0:21:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要联系开罗的专家 - 开罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need specialists from cairo… - cairo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.49,0:21:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,密封衣和屏蔽手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}…seaborn suits and shielding cuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 我们没时间了 你最好现在带上你要带走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, we are out of time. you better grab what you can now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.46,0:21:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会走的 除非我看清井里面有什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving until I see what's in that pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得离开这 我们现在要立刻撤退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh you are leaving. we're leaving right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.85,0:21:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我千里迢迢而来不会空手而归的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not come this far just to leave without…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.42,0:22:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire! Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.88,0:22:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火 停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cease fire! cease fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.41,0:22:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是些骆驼蜘蛛 这些蜘蛛没毒性\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are just camel spiders! they're not even poisonous!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在能离开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please, leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.62,0:22:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗 韦尔 - 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- are you out of your mind, Vail? - please!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.70,0:22:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里出了毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.83,0:22:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西咬了我的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing bit my neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.97,0:22:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事的 没事的 - 它咬了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- okay… okay. - it bit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 我不管这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough of this! I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.89,0:23:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了 你们随意 反正我是要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm leaving! with or without you! i'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.00,0:23:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,它咬我了 拜托 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It bit me! please, nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.76,0:23:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please, leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.37,0:23:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赐予我自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have set me free.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我命中注定之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.82,0:24:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.07,0:24:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉格林威 让他派人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell greenway he is gonna send a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这东西带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get this thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他就得去解释为什么会把我丢在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or he is gonna have to explain why he left me behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.92,0:24:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.21,0:24:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,吊上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb by the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在平稳吊移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Climb line is steady.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝着九点方向过去点\N{\fnArial\fs30}More towards your nine o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.44,0:24:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,高度30英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding at 30 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.56,0:24:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,再高一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.98,0:25:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,B队呼叫E队 我们看见猛烈的沙尘暴从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bishop to echo. we have visual on a severe sandstorm…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.14,0:25:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,西面向E12前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}…heading west to echo 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.11,0:26:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.51,0:26:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 小心点 这可是有五千年历史呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… wait… please be careful. this is 5, 000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.56,0:26:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,60秒后起飞 动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds! in the air! let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在起飞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us off the ground now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.71,0:26:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔西 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Halsey, take a sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.52,0:27:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.75,0:27:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 顺便说句 不用谢 - 我要谢你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you are welcome by the way. - how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我救了你 不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I saved your… whatever it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.75,0:27:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你投下地狱火弹之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was safely hidden for 5, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.75,0:27:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可是在地底下安安稳稳地藏了5000年\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you dropped a hell-fire missile on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.07,0:27:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你可能永远都发现不了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you might have never found it otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.62,0:27:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 你不用谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again… you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的意义是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The significance of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.44,0:27:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美索不达米亚的一座墓穴内发现古埃及石棺\N{\fnArial\fs30}An egyptian sarcophagus in a tomb in mesopotamia.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.17,0:28:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么说「只有15秒钟」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why just say "15 seconds"?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.94,0:28:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么跟什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.39,0:28:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才跟格林威说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told greenway that I can mimic all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.42,0:28:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你啪啪啪\N{\fnArial\fs30}the qualities of.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.23,0:28:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,15秒就射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.71,0:28:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 啊 肯定不止15秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… uh… it was not 15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.12,0:28:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 不管多长时间 这都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, however long it lasted, it wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.53,0:28:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的感觉都是真实的 我从没骗过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never lied to you about my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.98,0:28:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷我东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stole from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有对你说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I didn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.17,0:28:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是从来不会替别人考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever think of anyone but yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.17,0:28:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意义重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}This means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.76,0:28:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,超乎你想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something bigger than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我毕生心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.41,0:28:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你却来偷走了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were going to steal it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.67,0:28:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这东西在黑市上能值多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you think that's worth on the black market?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.34,0:29:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是詹妮弗·哈尔西博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dr. Jennifer Halsey…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在对这具古埃及石棺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conducting a preliminary analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.42,0:29:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,做初步检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}of an egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.28,0:29:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在伊拉克北部的尼尼微省发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…discovered in the nineveh province, northern iraq.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.10,0:29:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些象形文字绝对记载着一个新王朝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hieroglyphs are definitely new kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.10,0:29:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,墓棺上面记载着王后 梅内普莱因难产而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears that the wife of king menehptre…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.43,0:29:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}…died in childbirth…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.88,0:29:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子作为王国的继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…leaving a sole heir to the throne…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.90,0:29:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a girl…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.57,0:29:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫安玛奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}…called Ahmanet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.62,0:30:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,下士 你究竟在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal, what in the living hell are you doing son?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.87,0:30:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.57,0:30:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔下士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal Vail?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.10,0:30:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔下士 你听到我跟你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Corporal Vail, do you hear me talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.87,0:30:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么了吧 我说 放下刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you? I said! drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.82,0:30:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail, just…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.30,0:30:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔 哇哦 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail! wow… wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.09,0:30:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.97,0:30:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 见鬼了 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.11,0:30:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 立刻放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the weapon! drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.35,0:30:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.25,0:30:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please… please…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.37,0:30:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.35,0:30:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下枪 - 把它扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- put the gun down! - drop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.59,0:30:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 放下 坐回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put down the weapon! put it down… back off…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.04,0:30:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 不能在加压了的机舱开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! do not shoot! this is a pressurized aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.36,0:30:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.87,0:30:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.19,0:30:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦尔 把刀放下 - 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vail, put the knife down. - Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.67,0:30:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦尔 不 - 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vail, no. - Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.11,0:30:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.09,0:31:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔 停 停 韦尔 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ehy Vail! stop! stop! Vail… Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.85,0:31:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.40,0:31:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,故障 故障 故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pan-pan-pan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.88,0:31:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是N4-0-9-9\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is november 4-0-9-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.76,0:31:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国空军C-130大力神运输机\N{\fnArial\fs30}United states c-130 hercules.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.10,0:31:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发生了什么事 - 做好扣紧安全带\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's happening? - take your sit and strap in.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.09,0:31:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在英国上空 - 英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …over england. - england?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.16,0:31:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我也不知道发生了什么事 坐好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now I don't know what's happening. take your sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个引擎都失灵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost thrust in both engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.25,0:31:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,无线电失联 正从12000英尺骤降 离爱丁堡机场280英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way to our contact. dropping to 12, 000, 280 on the edi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.91,0:31:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑 快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! go! go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parachute!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parachute!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.36,0:32:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know how to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.42,0:32:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 你能做到 的 你能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, you can do this! you can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.83,0:32:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.81,0:33:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔西小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Halsey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.10,0:33:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈尔西小姐 你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Halsey, do you think you're up to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.54,0:34:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.51,0:34:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你来帮忙辨认下尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help identifying the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.30,0:34:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.75,0:35:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vail!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.49,0:35:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.54,0:35:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the shit out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.53,0:35:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.61,0:35:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.41,0:35:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.54,0:35:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.41,0:35:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没死 但是你还不如死了好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. but you are gonna wish you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.03,0:35:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,请这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.23,0:35:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我的天啊 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god! nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.81,0:35:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.72,0:35:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么事 我在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening? where am i?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.66,0:35:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是这里的负责人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's in charge here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.68,0:35:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,基地 这里是搜救一队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Base, this is search team one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.35,0:35:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们似乎找到了坠机残骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the trail of wreckage…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.73,0:35:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,残骸散落在方圆2-2.5英里的森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}…it's spread across 2-2, 5 half miles through the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.97,0:35:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正派人到埃尔斯福德港 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming up on the aylestord pier now. standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.84,0:35:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,码头上有件残骸 看上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pier is a wreck. it looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.77,0:36:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是部分机翼 是一台涡轮机发动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}a part of the wing.A turbine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.48,0:36:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离坠机主要现场几英里 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miles away from the primary crash site. over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.17,0:36:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 这里是搜救一队 收到信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, search team one. message received.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.34,0:36:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一具尸体 已经没用生命迹象 待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}One body found. no obvious signs of life. standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.55,0:36:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤员确认死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casualty confirmed deceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.09,0:36:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,请派医护人员到场 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requesting attendance of ambulance personnel. over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.15,0:36:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜救一队收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy, search team one.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.56,0:36:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗队已出发 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ambulance staff now on route. over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.93,0:37:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… what the hell…?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.24,0:37:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你们最好能过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! you better come in to…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.39,0:37:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allen?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.73,0:37:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allen?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.40,0:37:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.71,0:37:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allen!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.80,0:38:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.32,0:38:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.05,0:39:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架美国军机今晚在苏里市坠毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A US military plane crash landed in surrey this evening…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.48,0:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦弗利修道院差一点就被殃及\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just missing waverley abbey.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.19,0:39:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos（1046.8，810.8）\c&HE2BAF0&\b0\1a&H50&}即时新闻 威弗尼修道院地区
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.21,0:39:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fs60\c&HD7C6E2&\pos（673.2，894.4）}美国军用飞机坠毁
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.53,0:39:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么逃出飞机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get out of that plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.06,0:39:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连点儿轻伤都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a single scratch on your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.79,0:39:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.17,0:40:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.90,0:40:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.95,0:40:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,换做你 你也会为我做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have done the same for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.87,0:40:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.10,0:40:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.50,0:40:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可能知道了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.24,0:40:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我和一个考古专家小组工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I work with a group of archaeologists.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.10,0:40:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yeah. - well…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.40,0:40:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个这样的推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}…we developed this theory…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.96,0:40:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个古埃及公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that an egyptian princess had been.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.11,0:40:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在历史书上被抹掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}erased from the history book.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.43,0:40:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…deliberately.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.68,0:40:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直寻找一个叫做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been searching for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯之刃的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}called "the darue in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.89,0:40:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把顶端嵌着红宝石的祭祀刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ceremonial knife with a large jewel at the hilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.75,0:40:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯是古埃及的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seth is the egyptian god of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.48,0:40:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,据传说记载 将刀石合一\N{\fnArial\fs30}And legend has it that the dagger and the stone, together…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.59,0:40:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能让赛斯化为真身\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had the power to give seth physical form.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.40,0:40:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为它被藏在欧洲这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm convinced it was hidden here, in europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.24,0:40:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在几个世纪之前被十字军盗走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stolen by crusaders centuries ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.17,0:40:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一个十字军骑士的手稿里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found reference to it in a manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.58,0:40:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到了相关记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}written by a crue in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.50,0:41:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面说匕首与红宝石被拆开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That suggested the dagger was broken apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.40,0:41:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位骑士带着红宝石被\N{\fnArial\fs30}That the stone buried with this knight…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.51,0:41:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起安葬于英国的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}…somewhere here in england.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.03,0:41:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近在伦敦发现了一个大型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A massive crusader tomb, was.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.08,0:41:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字军墓穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}recently discoversaw those birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信红宝石就藏在那的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We believe that the stone is in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.56,0:41:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这个墓穴让我们找到了安玛奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That tomb is what led us to Ahmanet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.52,0:41:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为她就是记载中的那个公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she is the princess in the legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.14,0:41:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些象形文字说是她谋杀了她的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hieroglyphics said that she murdered her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.54,0:41:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谋杀 - 还有她父亲的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- murdered? - along with his child.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.44,0:41:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她与死神签订了某种契约\N{\fnArial\fs30}She made some sort of pact with the god of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.90,0:41:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且后来 当我看到那些鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, when I saw those birds…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.80,0:41:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有沙尘暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that sandstorm…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.90,0:41:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就感觉到大事不妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever I mean something is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.68,0:41:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你活下来了 但是我不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are alive I do not know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.30,0:41:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 我 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… i… go…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 尼克 我想我们惹怒了神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, nick. I think we angered the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.23,0:41:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.69,0:41:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.91,0:41:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请表明身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Identify, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.53,0:42:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是詹妮弗 帮我转接亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jenny. get me Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.33,0:42:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.29,0:42:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个问题比我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a far more significant.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.97,0:42:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象的严重多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}problem than we have ever imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.93,0:42:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,出大事了 亨利 我很担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is happening, Henry. i'm worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.50,0:42:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,派你的人到伦敦来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring your soldier to London. do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.02,0:42:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再和他深入谈论了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not discuss anything further with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.05,0:42:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.57,0:42:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.93,0:42:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮看起来很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.12,0:42:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 这不是真的 - 真到不能再真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ok this isn't happening. - I mean really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.16,0:42:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你停下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok. really stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.38,0:42:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我一直认为我和她是有机会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I always thought I had a chance with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.98,0:42:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你怎么可以这么渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what? - how do you squander that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.20,0:42:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是墓地里的水银蒸汽\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was mercury in that tomb. vapors.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.89,0:42:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么把它搞砸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you mess that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.28,0:42:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.37,0:42:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.54,0:42:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朝我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.60,0:42:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么 等下等下等下 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. what… wait wait wait you…you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.57,0:42:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.79,0:42:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刺死了格林威\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you stabbed greenway.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.64,0:42:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我救了你 - 你杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saved you. - you murdered him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.09,0:42:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就向我开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you shot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.57,0:42:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀我 你真是想杀珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried to kill me. you even went after jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.41,0:42:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向我开枪了 三枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot me. three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.28,0:43:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.29,0:43:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,三次 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.26,0:43:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三次没必要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third one was unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓坏我了 我失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You freaked me out. I panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.70,0:43:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.12,0:43:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.18,0:43:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我 看着我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me. look at my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被诅咒了 尼克 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cursed nick, and you are cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.84,0:43:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种方式破除诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there is only one way to break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.48,0:43:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是完成她要你做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to do exactly what she wants…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.42,0:43:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然咱俩全吃不了兜着走\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or this is gonna get a lot worse for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.12,0:43:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我被诅咒了是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean i'm cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.52,0:43:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.62,0:43:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 就 在给我一分钟的时间 谢谢你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… uh… give me a minute. thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.69,0:43:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说下你进的是女厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked into the chicks bathroom by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.80,0:43:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你自己的洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to your own bathroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.04,0:43:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是女厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's the ladies room.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.54,0:43:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我被诅咒了是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean i'm cursed?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.08,0:43:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你是怎么从空难中活下来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think you survived the crash?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.25,0:43:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,「史特派尔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"setapai".
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.30,0:43:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这是什么意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.78,0:43:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有个关于你的计划 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got plans for you, nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.12,0:43:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.06,0:43:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.40,0:43:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.34,0:45:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.16,0:45:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从路中间滚开 傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the road, wanker!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.52,0:45:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.55,0:45:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.20,0:45:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.31,0:45:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们惹怒了神灵 - 等等 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we angered the gods. - wait… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.07,0:45:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到她了 在棺木里的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw her… the chick in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.71,0:45:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安玛奈特 - 那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ahmanet? - that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.97,0:45:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克 - 他说我被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- nick… - he said i'm cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.39,0:45:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁说的 - 韦尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- who said? - Vail.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.55,0:45:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 韦尔 - 我们发现的那口棺材的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Vail? - the coffin we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.91,0:45:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是石棺 - 管他什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sarcophagus. - whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.98,0:45:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那上面有字\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was writing on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.06,0:45:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是象形文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hieroglyphics.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.05,0:45:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 说真的 我现在对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, respectfully, i'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.06,0:45:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古术语不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}in archeological jargon right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带出墓穴的棺材上刻着文字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The writing on the box that we took out of the hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.20,0:45:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.03,0:45:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是有关诅咒的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was something about a curse in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.22,0:45:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那玩意儿还在吗 找到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}there, was it there？was it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.35,0:46:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 你有点脑震荡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, you've had a concussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.20,0:46:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是有点 - 暴露在毒气（汞蒸气）中太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- yes. - toxic exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.17,0:46:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你解释 我为什么会知道「史特派尔」的意思是命定之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dose that explain that I know that "Aetapai"means"my chosen".
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.06,0:46:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是古埃及文 - 是古埃及文\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it's ancient egyptian. - ancient egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.37,0:46:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.19,0:46:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在中东呆了很多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been in the middle east for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.32,0:46:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? no!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.13,0:46:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定听过 只不过你忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard it… you forgot it…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.23,0:46:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么就是不相信我 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you backing off from this? i'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.66,0:46:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她活过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.86,0:46:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.59,0:46:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick… what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.15,0:46:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.28,0:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 脑袋里一团麻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… this is all in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.37,0:46:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找到那个棺材吗 打开看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you find the box, look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.17,0:46:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我看到一个三千岁的木乃伊在里面时\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and when I see a 3, 000 years old prune in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.41,0:46:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尼克 - 我就相信没诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- nick. - …no more curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.17,0:46:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要石棺 你需要看医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need a sarcophagus, you need a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.38,0:46:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.25,0:46:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是伦敦的一个专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}A specialist in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.95,0:46:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我说你也不想去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me that you don't want to see it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.24,0:46:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的毕生心血 拜托啊 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life's work, come on Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.91,0:46:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道它在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.92,0:47:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,C8-1报告基地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie 8-1 the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.47,0:47:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到达坠机现场 在威弗利修道院以北四百米处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at impact site, 400m north of waverley abbey.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.36,0:47:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,消防员控制火势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Firefighters control the fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.92,0:47:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.45,0:47:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick! where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.02,0:48:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠毁地点不是那里 你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crash isn't up that way. where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.90,0:48:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的方向是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.68,0:48:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.85,0:48:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.35,0:48:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在搞不懂我们要在这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what we're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.62,0:48:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,石棺不在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.69,0:48:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.57,0:48:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.35,0:48:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要的坠毁地带在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The main crash site it's up that way…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,石棺也在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and so is my artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.61,0:48:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是我们要去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where we are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.46,0:49:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.22,0:49:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did i…?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.37,0:49:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.86,0:49:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.26,0:50:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.44,0:50:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.05,0:50:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.35,0:50:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of death…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.36,0:50:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.27,0:50:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Powerful seth…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.30,0:50:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进入这个凡人的肉体\N{\fnArial\fs30}…i welcome you into this mortal body…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.87,0:50:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.45,0:50:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我融为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unite to me finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.55,0:51:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.97,0:51:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.08,0:51:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.52,0:52:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.23,0:52:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.07,0:52:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.66,0:52:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.31,0:52:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! no! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.49,0:52:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Nick! no!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.87,0:52:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.41,0:52:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚准备抛下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you just gonna leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.79,0:52:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.98,0:52:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟然要抛下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.10,0:52:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看见了 是吗 - 我怎么可能没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you saw it, right? - I can't unsee it!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.62,0:52:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.55,0:52:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 前面有条高速公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from here. there's a highway up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.11,0:52:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道 - 我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- how do you know? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.85,0:52:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你知道这都是些什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god. do you realize what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.35,0:52:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛斯之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the dagger of seth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.61,0:52:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刚准备用这东西刺穿我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was gonna drive that thing right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.81,0:52:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块宝石 不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stone, it is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.82,0:52:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 看起来好像把她激怒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it seems to have really pissed her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.64,0:52:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.43,0:53:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会在那座雕像里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was in that statue?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.07,0:53:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那雕像是个圣器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That statue was a reliquary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.14,0:53:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,十字军用它们来隐藏圣物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crusaders have been using them to hide holy relics.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.23,0:53:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她知道宝石就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she knew it was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.89,0:53:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是她故意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are saying that she brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.55,0:53:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让飞机坠毁在教堂附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}the plane down thgo to the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.58,0:53:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这解释了为什么她想让你来教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why she wanted you to come to the church.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.46,0:53:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想让我来这座教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wanted me to go to the church?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.67,0:53:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你是我想来教堂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you that I wanted to go to church.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.94,0:53:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我说的是 我想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you… I said… that I wanted to see…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.70,0:53:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想看她的尸体 - 看她的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanted to see her corpse. - see her corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.56,0:53:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 她就在你脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick she is in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.71,0:53:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么 那\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? that…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.11,0:53:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那简直太可笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that is ridiculous because I…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.19,0:53:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么把车开回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drove right back to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.74,0:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 她真的在我脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god she is in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.98,0:53:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go go go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.53,0:54:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把它弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.29,0:54:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.73,0:54:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的脸 是我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my face! that's my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.98,0:54:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.39,0:54:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.09,0:55:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.39,0:55:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.74,0:55:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.71,0:55:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.26,0:55:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.53,0:55:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.96,0:55:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉她 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her, nick!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.94,0:55:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉她 干掉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her! get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.76,0:55:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,打死她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.18,0:56:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二分队 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phase two! quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.55,0:56:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,将她往后拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.23,0:56:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,突击队行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delta team move!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.89,0:56:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,将目标击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the target down!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.07,0:56:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.24,0:57:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要带我去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.34,0:57:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.63,0:57:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.74,0:58:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必约束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.61,0:58:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.95,0:58:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am i?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.79,0:58:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,更重要的问题是 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more relevant question, Mr. Morton…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.60,0:58:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who exactly are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.70,0:58:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上 我了解你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}In theory, I know all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.64,0:58:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,武装侦查兵 受过表彰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army reconnaissance, decorated soldier…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.97,0:58:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里一页页都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and page after page indicating a.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.75,0:58:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的种种劣迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}deep and troubling.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.48,0:58:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 这些文件对于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you see, this file contains.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.95,0:58:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点价值都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing of any real value to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.47,0:58:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我想跟你面对面谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I wanted to see you face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.06,0:58:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.55,0:58:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一名博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.15,0:58:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.74,0:58:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究化学病理学以及神经外科\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chemical pathology, neurosurgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.71,0:59:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是皇家学会成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}member of the Royal Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.94,0:59:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am also a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.57,0:59:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字叫哲基尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Jekyll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.33,0:59:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利·哲基尔博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Henry Jekyll.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.82,0:59:11.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.56,0:59:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些天 我在研究免疫学\N{\fnArial\fs30}This days, I specialize in immunology, perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.11,0:59:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及流行病学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Infectious diseases perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.61,0:59:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 如果可以的话 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to, if I may, Mr. Morton…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.86,0:59:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你一个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to tell you a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.51,0:59:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个病人的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A story about a patient of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.47,0:59:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个信守诺言的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.88,0:59:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个相信自己无可挑剔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man who believed he was beyond reproach…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.07,0:59:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到他病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…until he got ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.82,0:59:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种病开始会通过一些细微的地方表现出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The disease manifested itself in subtle ways at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.50,0:59:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但情况会逐渐恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then it grew…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.45,0:59:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到成为一种毁灭性\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into an overwhelming desire…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.13,0:59:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可抑制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an unquenchable thirst…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.21,0:59:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.34,1:00:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他人带来灾难\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the suffering of others.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.22,1:00:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was quite fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.29,1:00:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己就是个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He himself was a physician.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.70,1:00:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果邪恶是一种病原体 那就有理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if evil were a pathogen, to be reasoned…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.25,1:00:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,能够将它治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then there must surely be a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.72,1:00:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 如果可以的话 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to, if I may, Mr. Morton…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.67,1:00:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.61,1:00:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\frz3.797\b1\frx358\fry358\c&HB1E0EC&\1a&H00&\pos（1210.134，352.4）}身份识别中
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.35,1:00:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\pos（938.666，207.333）}{\c&HCDE7E6&\be1}哲基尔.H.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.95,1:01:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到博见部 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to prodigium, Mr. Morton.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.30,1:01:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自拉丁语\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the latin, "monstrum vel prodigium".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.03,1:01:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有关怪兽的警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}"a warning of monsters".
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.21,1:01:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘掉你之前的认知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive the state of things.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.47,1:01:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们几乎没时间为我们的客人做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had very little time to prepare for our guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.17,1:01:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有珍妮弗提供的信息才能继续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only the information Jennifer provided to go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.75,1:01:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 她为我们工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}In truth, she works for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.98,1:01:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事并没有经过精准的科学推论\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not an exact science, this business.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.57,1:01:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the business being?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.84,1:01:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil, Mr. Morton.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.14,1:01:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,公认的 可控的 经检测的 具有毁灭性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recognized, contained, examined, destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.94,1:01:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是 我们至今遇到过的最古老的邪灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is, by far, the most ancient we have ever encountered.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.79,1:01:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对她做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.31,1:01:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她注射汞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embalming her with mercury.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.17,1:01:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到零下38度的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}At - 38 degrees…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.15,1:02:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她血管中的汞就会凝固\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the mercury in her veins will solidify…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.59,1:02:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候解剖她就没什么问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and she should be safe for dissection then.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.77,1:02:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,解剖 你说过我们只是研究她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dissection? you said that we'd study her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.78,1:02:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 通过解剖来研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, by dissection.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.04,1:02:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她是古埃及那段鲜为人知历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she is a living witness to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.44,1:02:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一活着的见证者\N{\fnArial\fs30}a history that we barely know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.08,1:02:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是个威胁 珍妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a threat, Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.26,1:02:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 这关我什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, hold on. so… where does that leave me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.04,1:02:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被诅咒了 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cursed, Mr. Morton.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.64,1:02:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得的可不是普通的感冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not some common cold you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.01,1:02:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点鸡汤睡上一个好觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some chicken soup and a good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.76,1:02:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不能治好你的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}sleep will not make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.79,1:02:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经被选中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been selected…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.22,1:02:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个终极邪灵的容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as the vessel for the ultimate evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.68,1:02:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有我们才能帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we are the only ones who can rectify that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.98,1:02:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法改变你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot change your fate.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.36,1:02:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒永远也不会被破解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The curse will never be broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.62,1:02:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上一个选中的人已经被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}My chosen one was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.40,1:02:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会接替他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will take his place.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.53,1:03:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你选中了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you choose him…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.44,1:03:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.40,1:03:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你要杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were you going to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.58,1:03:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打算杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was not going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.40,1:03:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想要给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to give him…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.01,1:03:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}…eternal life.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.62,1:03:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他成为神祇在世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it a living god.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.50,1:03:25.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You murdered your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.81,1:03:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我全心全意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved my father…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.61,1:03:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱着我的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.29,1:03:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让他也一样爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only wanted his love in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.50,1:03:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed his wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.35,1:03:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their child.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.31,1:03:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,今非昔比 情非得已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were different times.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.98,1:04:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的觉醒之日就要来临\N{\fnArial\fs30}The day of the awakening will soon be upon us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.12,1:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will become seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.95,1:04:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界会掌控在你手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world will fall to your desire.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.06,1:04:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将掌握生死之权\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have power of life over death.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.77,1:04:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会拥有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will have me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.08,1:04:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会成为你的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be your queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.14,1:04:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妥协吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.79,1:04:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.67,1:04:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.85,1:04:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.05,1:04:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will kill you…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.71,1:04:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们杀死上一个命定之人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…just as they killed my chosen before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.33,1:04:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.51,1:04:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.69,1:04:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.99,1:05:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.30,1:05:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.72,1:05:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.37,1:05:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.19,1:05:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.17,1:05:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.17,1:05:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该怎么跟你解释呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.88,1:05:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我说这个地方真实存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you even have believed me if.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}i said that this place was real?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.04,1:05:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利找到我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Henry came to me…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.52,1:05:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我因为和他们志同道合而接下了这份工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}…i took the job because we had a common interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.55,1:05:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有你俩是相互利用的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are using each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.91,1:05:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她就在利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, she's using you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.96,1:05:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.51,1:05:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite what you might think…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.31,1:05:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…despite my…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.85,1:06:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,的判断有多客观\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my better judgment…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.08,1:06:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…i care about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.32,1:06:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心深处 奋勇突围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in there, fighting to get out…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.21,1:06:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.74,1:06:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.14,1:06:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.43,1:06:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.53,1:06:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在飞机上救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life on that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.38,1:06:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毫不犹豫就把唯一的降落伞给了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave me the only parachute without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.40,1:06:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为不止一把呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there was another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.82,1:06:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. morton.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.16,1:06:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,要喝一杯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.97,1:07:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我这里有你喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found something.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you have seen…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.10,1:07:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所识\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you must know…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.96,1:07:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究过古神灵的语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have studied the word of the old gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.29,1:07:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,古神灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old gods?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.35,1:08:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的语言太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your language is simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.50,1:08:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真正想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you truly wish to know…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.89,1:08:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是死亡面纱背后的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is what lies beyond the veil of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.28,1:08:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我曾看到的一切吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know what I have seen?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.52,1:08:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.27,1:08:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.33,1:08:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我杀死你的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.77,1:08:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have found the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.46,1:08:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我选中的人带来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought my chosen here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.66,1:08:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜他们现在要对他做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think they will do with him now?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.76,1:09:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到新世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to a new world…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.55,1:09:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,神灵和怪物的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of gods and monsters.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.87,1:09:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔有很多名字 莫顿先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil has many names, mr. morton.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.54,1:09:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说被称为赛斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take seth, for example.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.55,1:09:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是古埃及人眼中的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known to egyptians as the god of death.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.93,1:09:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旧约中他还被称为撒旦 路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the old tastament:Satan, lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.79,1:09:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是恶魔 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the devil. - quite so.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.72,1:09:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 很坏很坏 都得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. bad… bad… gotta…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.83,1:09:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 恶魔是存在于我们世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see evil is the shadow that.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.65,1:09:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,之外的阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}exists just outside our world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.05,1:09:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不断寻找方法进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…continuously searching for a way to come in…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.91,1:09:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为转化成血肉之躯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a way to become flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.46,1:09:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们也不会坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either… we wait for that day to arrive…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.54,1:09:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用自己的方式与他们对抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or we can fight it on our own terms.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.72,1:09:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我找到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings me to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.34,1:10:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 是的 我明白 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? yeah, great, yes… doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.10,1:10:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你可以解除我的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that you could cure me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.84,1:10:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,彻底摆脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}of this curse.Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.47,1:10:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们赶快行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's do it doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.27,1:10:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.84,1:10:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫顿先生 这事可能有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. morton, these things are complex.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.60,1:10:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? I bet, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.65,1:10:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你要处理人类的救赎时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When one is dealing with the salvation of humanity…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.59,1:10:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕要做出一点牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}…certain sacrifices must be made.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.00,1:10:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.46,1:10:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.51,1:10:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What found… what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.56,1:10:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.80,1:10:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是打算杀了他么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you planning on killing him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.56,1:10:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.56,1:10:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 詹妮弗 - 杀了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jennifer… - kill who?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.44,1:10:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫顿先生自一开始弄断锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. morton here essentially killed himself…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.02,1:10:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,的时候就已经在劫难逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when he severed the barrier chain…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.93,1:10:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他解除了安玛奈特身上五千年的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that had kept Ahmanet power imprisoned for 5, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.28,1:10:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被选为她最理想的候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was chosen as her ideal candidate.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.23,1:10:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个身强体壮 无比狡猾\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thief, physically capable, compulsively devious…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.55,1:10:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灵魂的小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and utterly devoid of soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.06,1:10:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what? - what?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.52,1:11:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.69,1:11:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想把宝石镶嵌在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to put the stone in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.98,1:11:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,匕首上 然后给他来一刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}the dagger and stab him with it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.31,1:11:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,匕首会让赛斯进入到他体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dagger will allow seth to enter his body.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.21,1:11:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就能彻底毁灭它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we obliterate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.62,1:11:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.71,1:11:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要用那玩意儿捅死我 还是故意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to stab me with that thing? intentionally?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.85,1:11:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,古埃及人就是这么干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely what the egyptians should have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看他们打断了进行中的仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, they interrupted a ritual in process…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.81,1:11:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的错我们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that is mistake we cannot…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.40,1:11:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要避免再犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}…afford to repeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.97,1:11:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的计划 - 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's the plan? - Henry…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.54,1:11:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can't possibly do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.80,1:11:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.08,1:11:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,多米诺骨牌已经开始到下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dominoes are already falling.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.76,1:11:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.26,1:11:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我们必须要冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, it is a risk we must take.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.02,1:11:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是你的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.67,1:11:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到安玛奈特怎么说的了 你的诅咒无法破除\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard Ahmanet. your curse cannot be broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.70,1:11:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉 莫顿先生 不管我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly sorry, mr. morton. No matter what I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.52,1:11:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都是死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.34,1:11:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 邪恶就是一种瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, evil is a disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.63,1:12:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种致命的瘟疫感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pestilent pustulant infection…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.16,1:12:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,会腐蚀我们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}…borrowing its way into our souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.25,1:12:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界需要解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world needs a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.48,1:12:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你就是那味药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be that cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.88,1:12:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.95,1:12:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲自己拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacrifice for the greater good!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.47,1:12:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对此根本就不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in that at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.23,1:12:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.18,1:12:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 把注射器给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- don't! - give me the injector.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.31,1:12:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们停下来休息一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are just gonna take a minute…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.74,1:12:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们可以商量出一个新的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and we are all gonna come up with a new plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.66,1:12:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.48,1:12:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你干了什么好事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you are doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.57,1:12:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我很清楚我在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? I know exactly what i'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.07,1:12:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我亲爱的亨利·杰奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my dear Henry jekyll…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.26,1:12:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,要说我曾在你的新朋友的脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if ever i've seen satan signature upon a face…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.69,1:12:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见撒旦的印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is on that of your new friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.29,1:12:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey hey! take it!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.09,1:12:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.46,1:12:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 莫顿先生 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- run, mr. morton. - what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.38,1:12:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.71,1:12:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick! open the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.04,1:12:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.80,1:12:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.45,1:12:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.00,1:13:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会放我出去的 尼古拉斯 他们不会放我出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't let me out, nicholas. they never do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.52,1:13:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇哦 这都是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woah woah what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.29,1:13:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把水银关掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you just shut down the mercury.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.29,1:13:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.39,1:13:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是太年轻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a younger man…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.59,1:13:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要学会警惕像我这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but you must learn to be wary of a man like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.52,1:13:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我想杀你 是亨利想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me that wants to kill you, it's Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.02,1:14:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻我有个合作的想法 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have something more collaborative to that moment.I know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.62,1:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我合作吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm offering you a partnership.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.39,1:14:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 是恶魔的化身 我 是你的好朋友 艾迪·海德\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, evil incarnate. me, your good friend, eddie hyde.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.94,1:14:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.71,1:14:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.53,1:14:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.45,1:14:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.75,1:15:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 孩子 想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, son. think about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.31,1:15:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我集混乱与毁灭于一身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am chaos, destruction.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.66,1:15:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人们会拜倒在我们的牛仔裤下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ladies will love us.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.57,1:15:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.53,1:15:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实在是享受你痛苦的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do enjoy the garments of pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.61,1:15:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的 莫顿先生 好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, mr. morton. well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.16,1:15:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我们得毁掉宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. we have to destroy the stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.51,1:15:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.55,1:15:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有宝石 没有仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stone, no ritual.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.78,1:15:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}No ritual…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.86,1:16:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就没有诅咒 - 是的 我知道在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …no curse. - yes. I know where it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.81,1:17:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等 等等 哪条路可以出去 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just wait, wait, which way out? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.26,1:17:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}God of death…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.45,1:17:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,将我选中的人带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring forth my chosen…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.67,1:17:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我召唤埃及之沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I summon the sands of egypt…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.62,1:17:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,受我召唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me in!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.86,1:17:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deliver him to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.15,1:17:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.35,1:17:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她逃跑了 拿走了匕首\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's out! she has the dagger.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.77,1:17:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为她向你们那边过去了 我们随后就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thinks she is coming to you, so are we.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.69,1:18:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁上门 保护好宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock your doors and secure that stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.53,1:19:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.23,1:19:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克 我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.60,1:19:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道宝石在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where the stone is!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.29,1:19:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.50,1:19:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 这真刺激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that was intense!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.91,1:19:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.93,1:19:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在去十字军墓室的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are headed to the crusader burial chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.60,1:19:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从西边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make our entry through the.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.34,1:19:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道进去 完毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}northwest train tunnels, over.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.05,1:20:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候了 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the moment, nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.97,1:20:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the moment!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.69,1:20:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你说的对极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.34,1:20:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你和宝石一起给安玛奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna taking that stone, deliver you to Ahmanet…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.09,1:20:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我的使命就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then my work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.08,1:20:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.60,1:20:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.80,1:20:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.72,1:20:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.94,1:20:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,安玛奈特是不会放过她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahmanet is never going to let her live.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.34,1:20:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救不了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't save her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.38,1:20:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来吧 我的战士们 听我命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arise, my warriors, and serve me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.20,1:20:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! oh no!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.50,1:21:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.40,1:21:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.06,1:21:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.45,1:22:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不应该出现在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.62,1:22:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed you!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.11,1:22:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go go go!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.52,1:23:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.74,1:23:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪里了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- where are we? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.59,1:23:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.34,1:23:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很害怕 - 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- i'm scared. - just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.32,1:23:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.15,1:23:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想和你呆在一起 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, I need you to just stay with me, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.62,1:24:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are gonna figure this out…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.15,1:24:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你呆在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}i need you to just stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.95,1:24:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和我呆在一起 我们能想出办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay with me. we'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.92,1:24:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! jenny!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.46,1:25:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny! no!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.44,1:25:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.83,1:25:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.31,1:26:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.12,1:26:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.33,1:26:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要责备自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.58,1:26:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她注定难逃此劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was always doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.43,1:27:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有比死更可怕的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are worse fates than death.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.70,1:27:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,来我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.52,1:27:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.69,1:27:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.78,1:27:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我消除你的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take pain away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.65,1:28:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give in to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.49,1:28:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,臣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.80,1:28:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,臣服吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give in.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.04,1:28:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当一切结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's over…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.78,1:28:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会感谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you will thank me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.84,1:29:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.73,1:29:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.99,1:29:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are just never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.60,1:29:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.90,1:29:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.43,1:29:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thief.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.04,1:29:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.73,1:29:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁掉宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the stone…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.52,1:29:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and all is lost.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.66,1:30:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会成为神祇在世\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be a living god.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.07,1:30:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将掌控生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have power of life over death.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.87,1:30:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.07,1:30:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的命定之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.24,1:30:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.46,1:30:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…my love.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.01,1:32:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in there…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.41,1:32:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…i know you're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.45,1:32:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个世界需要解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world needs a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.29,1:32:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是这味药\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be that cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.68,1:32:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲自己拯救世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sacrifice for the greater good!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.28,1:33:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.00,1:33:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.89,1:33:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.10,1:34:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.94,1:34:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.65,1:34:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.38,1:34:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.57,1:34:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 拜托醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.65,1:34:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.02,1:34:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what i'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.30,1:34:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托醒醒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.80,1:34:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.50,1:34:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒过来啊 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.31,1:34:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.78,1:34:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍妮 快醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jenny, just wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.50,1:34:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.53,1:35:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.12,1:35:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.58,1:35:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.08,1:35:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.80,1:35:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. please.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.76,1:35:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我现在是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.54,1:35:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you, jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.38,1:35:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.16,1:35:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.93,1:36:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你活过来我真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.27,1:36:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.11,1:36:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做这些是为了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.40,1:36:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.15,1:36:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have made so many…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.50,1:36:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多错事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…many mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.30,1:36:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.79,1:36:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.69,1:36:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.92,1:36:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never wanted to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.26,1:36:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.96,1:36:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没想过事情会变成这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't see this coming, did we?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.93,1:36:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.34,1:36:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望我们还有时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish we had more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.93,1:36:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.04,1:37:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 珍妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, jenny.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.46,1:37:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看错尼克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong about nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.07,1:37:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了救我牺牲了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave his life to save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.25,1:37:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了把我救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.01,1:37:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 詹妮弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Jennifer.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.08,1:37:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到了自己的救赎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found his redemption.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.90,1:37:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是代价如此之高\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at great cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.08,1:37:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a monster now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.01,1:38:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is also still a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:01.88,1:38:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.09,1:38:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.29,1:38:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始探索他的能力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet it has only begun to discover his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.10,1:38:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道哪股力量可以获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we cannot know which side will win out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.53,1:38:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在黑暗与光明之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between darkness and light…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.59,1:38:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在善良与邪恶之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}…good or evil.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.99,1:38:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.42,1:38:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.77,1:38:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真高兴能在这里呆着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really glad to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.77,1:38:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 谢谢你帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, thank you for bringing me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.23,1:38:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,复活及这一切 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to life and everything Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.82,1:38:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们来这里干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but what are we even doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.59,1:38:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.41,1:38:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我的老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.59,1:38:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的冒险精神去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your sense of adventure?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.27,1:38:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.61,1:38:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他的身上还有多少人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever human part of him remains…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.40,1:38:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,会踏遍世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will search the world over…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.97,1:38:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到方法打破诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for a way to break the curse.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.33,1:38:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找到解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}To find the cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.93,1:38:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔永远不会作罢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet evil never rests.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.86,1:39:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要时刻记着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will call to them…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.26,1:39:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远记着\N{\fnArial\fs30}…always.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.67,1:39:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利 他用自己的力量阻止了安玛奈特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry, he used his power to stop Ahmanet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.44,1:39:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比任何人更明白他能成为我们强大的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know more than anyone he could be our greatest ally.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.39,1:39:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.45,1:39:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时候让一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes it does take a monster…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.08,1:39:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,去迎战另外一个怪物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to fight a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fade（1000，1000）\c&H007AFF&}翻译：{\c&HFFFFFF&} CJ 我爱吃榴莲 wiji
